  "footer": {
    "html": "<div class=\"footer\">\n<div class=\"wrapper2\">\n<div class=\"d\">\n<div class=\"r footer-r\" id=\"footer-r\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">Matsuda Sangyo (Thailand) Co., Ltd. has an efficient logistics system for support requests from customers. </span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">We provide Harzadous and Non-harzadous waste and scrap transportation by GPS equiped 4 to 10 wheels closed cargo truck.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"> </span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">Matsuda Sangyo (Thailand) Co.,Ltd. operating with an advanced precious metal refining technology and environmental friendly know-how.</span></p> </div>\n<div class=\"r2 footer-r2\" id=\"footer-r2\">\n</div>\n<div class=\"r3 footer-r3\" id=\"footer-r3\">\n<p style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><strong>Matsuda Sangyo (Thailand) Co.,Ltd.</strong></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #ffffff; font-size: 19px; background-color: #333333;\">นิคมอุตสาหกรรมไฮเทค 148 หมู่ 1 ต.บ้านเลน</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #ffffff; font-size: 19px; background-color: #333333;\">A.Banpa-in, Ayutthaya 13160, Thailand.</span></p>\n<p style=\"color: #ea5504;\"><span style=\"color: #ffffff; font-family: CordiaUPC,times; font-size: 19px; background-color: #333333;\">Tel: (+66)35-729-001-5</span></p>\n<p style=\"color: #ea5504;\"><span style=\"color: #ffffff; font-family: CordiaUPC,times; font-size: 19px; background-color: #333333;\">Fax: (+66)35-729-007</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 18px;\"><strong>E-mail :</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;\">เริ่มต้นธุรกิจกับเรา :</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;\"><a href=\"mailto:sale1@matsuda-sangyo.co.th\">sale1@matsuda-sangyo.co.th</a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;\">โอกาสการงาน 